        "abstract": "Three types of spurious signals, generated by microwave transmitters are discussed: splatter, harmonic radiation and anharmonic radiation. The interference potentials and measurement problems of these types of radiation are discussed. Possible corrective measures in the form of receiver and transmitter filters are presented.",
